rage speed of 30MB/s, you can transfer a 1GB video in just 30 seconds.\n\n• No data is consumed during the transfer\nMobileTrans utilizes a local hotspot for data transfer, eliminating the need for a Wi-Fi connection. This means your data plan won't be used during the transfer process.\n\n• Supports the transfer of ALL types of data\nMobileTrans supports the transfer of all types of data to your new mobile phone, this includes images, videos, whatsapp data, audio, contacts, music, docs, and calendar events.\n\n• QR Code-Based Connection\nMobileTrans offers QR Code-based transfer, allowing you to connect two devices by simply scanning a QR code. It supports data transfer between different OS and various phone brands.\n\n• High Privacy & Data Security\nBoth MobileTrans and Wondershare place a strong emphasis on user privacy protection. MobileTrans acts solely as a bridge for data transfer, with the sole mission of ensuring the successful migration of all data to a new device.\n\n- MobileTrans’ PROS:\n\n• MobileTrans fully supports cross-platform data transfer\n\n• When transferring content, there's no need for an OTG data cable. Simply scan the QR code to establish a quick and secure connection between the old and new phones.\n\n• Data transfer is not limited by mobile phone brands.\n\n-Wondershare MobileTrans’ Features:\n\n• [Photo Transfer]: With MobileTrans, you no longer need to part with all the memories stored on your old phone when upgrading to a new one. When you switch phones, MobileTrans ensures you can keep the photos, videos, and audio files that mean the most to you.\n\n• [File Transfer]: Wondershare MobileTrans simplifies file transfers with just one click. It supports the transfer of all file formats, including Word, Excel, PowerPoint, PDF, ePub, and more.\n\n• [Contact & App Transfer]: MobileTrans lets you easily transfer contacts with a single click, saving time and preserving data integrity. It can also move cherished apps from un-downloadable sources to your new device.\n\n• [WhatsApp Transfer]: Easily, quickly and securely transfer all your WhatsApp data to a new phone, including chat history, contacts, photos, videos, and even stickers.\n\nSubscribe to get unlimited access to all features:\n- Phone Transfer\n- File Transfer\n- Photo Transfer\n- WhatsApp Transfer\n- Contact & App Transfer\n- iCloud Transfer\n- Phone-to-PC Transfer\n\nAvailable Subscriptions:\n- Phone Transfer Monthly\n- Full Feature Monthly\n- WhatsApp Monthly\n\nSubscription Terms:\nPayment will be charged to your iTunes account at the time of purchase.\nSubscriptions automatically renew unless auto-renew is turned off at least 24 hours before the end of the current period.\nYour account will be charged for renewal within 24 hours before the current period ends.\nYou can manage and turn off auto-renewal anytime in your Account Settings after purchase.\n\n- About the Developer-Wondershare \nWith more than one million users in more than 120 countries and regions around the world, Wondershare is a company dedicated to creative software.\n\nTerms of Use：\nhttps://www.apple.com/legal/internet-services/itunes/dev/stdeula/\n\n-Contact: customer_service@wondershare.com","buttonAction":{"title":"Get","presentationStyle":[],"actionMetrics":{"$kind":"ActionMetrics","data":[{"shouldFlush":false,"fields":{"reco_algoId":"cab_1","reco_eligible":"1","reco_hash":"cab_1","actionDetails":{"buyParams":"productType=C&price=0&salableAdamId=1545867834&pricingParameters=STDQ&pg=default&appExtVrsId=893980723"},"location":[{"locationPosition":0,"locationType":"button","name":"Get","reco_algoId":"cab_1","reco_eligible":"1","reco_hash":"cab_1","idType":"its_id","id":"1545867834"},{"locationPosition":8,"locationType":"lockup","name":"Smart Data Switch: MobileTrans","reco_algoId":"cab_1","reco_eligible":"1","reco_hash":"cab_1","idType":"its_id","id":"1545867834"},{"locationPosition":14,"locationType":"similarItems","name":"You Might Also Like","idType":"relationship","id