alse,"tertiaryTitle":null,"tertiaryTitleAction":null,"tertiaryTitleArtwork":null,"developerTagline":"Browse the web with ad blocker","editorialTagline":"Try a new browsing experience","shortEditorialDescription":"Multiple suggested and previously searched results, fast.","ageRating":"16+","productDescription":"The internet. As it should be.\n\nFirefox is a private web browser designed to protect your data, block trackers and make browsing fast, secure and simple. Whether you’re looking for an incognito browser, a private search experience, or a reliable browser for everyday use, Firefox puts you first.\n\nWhy people choose Firefox:\n\nMore privacy, less tracking – Firefox automatically blocks social media trackers, cross-site cookies, crypto miners and fingerprinting scripts.\nPrivate browsing that protects you – Open private tabs that don’t save your history, searches, or cookies. Lock them with your device security for extra protection.\nFewer ads, less clutter – Turn on built-in ad blocking to cut down on distracting ads, leaving more room for what you actually came to see.\nFast, smooth performance – Load pages faster by blocking trackers and reducing unnecessary data usage.\nGet Quick Answers – Ask Firefox a question by voice for a clear answer without digging through search results. \nQuick page summaries – Shake your phone to cut through long pages and get the key points.\nTabs that work for you – Easily organize and switch between tabs and sync them across devices to pick up where you left off.\nFocus without distractions – Reader View strips away clutter, while picture-in-picture lets you multitask with videos.\nPasswords made simple – Generate, store and autofill passwords securely.\nSearch your way – Use your preferred private search engine or switch easily from the search bar.\nControl your experience – Add extensions like ad blockers, customize settings and choose how you browse.\nAI on your terms – Turn AI completely off or customize it feature by feature.\nSync across devices – Access your bookmarks, tabs and passwords anywhere you use Firefox.\nMake it yours – Customize your home screen, layout and shortcuts for a more personal browsing experience.\n\nPrivate by default.\n\nFirefox is built to protect you. Enhanced Tracking Protection automatically blocks common trackers, and you can also turn on the built-in ad blocker for more control over your browsing and fewer distracting ads. When you need more privacy, private browsing mode ensures your history, searches and cookies aren’t saved.\n\nYour browser. Your rules.\n\nFirefox puts you in charge of your internet. Add privacy or productivity extensions, including ad blockers, move your search bar, choose your default search engine and tailor your browser to how you use the web. Sync your data across devices for a seamless, consistent experience.\n\n\nFocus with Firefox. Fast, secure and built around you.\n\nFirefox is designed to help you stay focused with faster, more secure browsing. Reader Mode removes clutter from articles, Picture-in-Picture keeps videos accessible while you multitask and Tracker Blocking helps pages load faster. Built-in password management and private browsing keep everyday browsing simple and protected.\n\nBuilt for people, not profit.\n\nFirefox was created in 2004 by Mozilla as a faster, more private and customizable browser designed to put people first. Today, Mozilla remains a nonprofit working to make the internet — and the time you spend on it — better.\n\nLearn more about Mozilla: https://www.mozilla.org\nTerms of Use: https://www.mozilla.org/about/legal/terms/firefox/\nPrivacy Policy: https://www.mozilla.org/privacy/firefox\nLatest news: https://blog.mozilla.org","buttonAction":{"title":"Get","presentationStyle":[],"actionMetrics":{"$kind":"ActionMetrics","data":[{"shouldFlush":false,"fields":{"reco_algoId":"cab_1","reco_eligible":"1","reco_hash":"cab_1","actionDetails":{"buyParams":"productType=C&price=0&salableAdamId=989804926&p