ons like ad blockers, customize settings and choose how you browse.\nAI on your terms – Turn AI completely off or customize it feature by feature.\nSync across devices – Access your bookmarks, tabs and passwords anywhere you use Firefox.\nMake it yours – Customize your home screen, layout and shortcuts for a more personal browsing experience.\n\nPrivate by default.\n\nFirefox is built to protect you. Enhanced Tracking Protection automatically blocks common trackers, and you can also turn on the built-in ad blocker for more control over your browsing and fewer distracting ads. When you need more privacy, private browsing mode ensures your history, searches and cookies aren’t saved.\n\nYour browser. Your rules.\n\nFirefox puts you in charge of your internet. Add privacy or productivity extensions, including ad blockers, move your search bar, choose your default search engine and tailor your browser to how you use the web. Sync your data across devices for a seamless, consistent experience.\n\n\nFocus with Firefox. Fast, secure and built around you.\n\nFirefox is designed to help you stay focused with faster, more secure browsing. Reader Mode removes clutter from articles, Picture-in-Picture keeps videos accessible while you multitask and Tracker Blocking helps pages load faster. Built-in password management and private browsing keep everyday browsing simple and protected.\n\nBuilt for people, not profit.\n\nFirefox was created in 2004 by Mozilla as a faster, more private and customizable browser designed to put people first. Today, Mozilla remains a nonprofit working to make the internet — and the time you spend on it — better.\n\nLearn more about Mozilla: https://www.mozilla.org\nTerms of Use: https://www.mozilla.org/about/legal/terms/firefox/\nPrivacy Policy: https://www.mozilla.org/privacy/firefox\nLatest news: https://blog.mozilla.org","buttonAction":{"title":"Get","presentationStyle":[],"actionMetrics":{"$kind":"ActionMetrics","data":[{"shouldFlush":false,"fields